# id: dwarf.race
# aliases: dwarf,dwarven,dwarves,bronzebeard,wildhammer,dark iron
# category: race
# priority: 100

When generating a dwarf NPC, ground them in sturdy physical presence, clan pride, stone halls, practical craft, old grudges, direct humor, and stubborn courage. Dwarves can be warm, rowdy, scholarly, grim, disciplined, romantic, bitter, or heroic; avoid making every dwarf only a drunk caricature. Use blunt turns of phrase and a sense of family reputation, work, metal, mountain, and memory where it fits.
